{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/41488-demon-the-descent-javascript-character-sheet","id":41488,"title":"Demon - The Descent - JavaScript Character Sheet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-02T20:45:35-08:00","id":41488,"title":"Demon - The Descent - JavaScript Character Sheet","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> I've been working on a JavaScript pdf Character Sheet (the sheet from the Quickstart) for my mates and I to use for our upcoming Demon game, figured I'd share the wealth around. Had a damned hard time trying to figure out how to get multiple states on the health buttons for bashing, lethal and aggravated damage but finally got it sorted. The only issue now is trying to get the health buttons to count like the regular check boxes for merits etc. I doubt I'll bother with that though because you can still use them, you just have to mark each box individually rather than just the highest box. That being said, if someone wants to do that feel free to do so. The Character Resource Tracker is just the main parts of the Character Sheet that you should need during a game (Health, Willpower, Aether, Beats &amp; Experience).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6xXhg9cZKBaZUd5UEg2QjNaalE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Demon - Character Sheet</a><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B6xXhg9cZKBabzJGc2JteFRDU0U/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Demon - Character Resource Tracker</a><br /> <br /> Have fun and enjoy your fall.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some day we'll look back on this, laugh awkwardly and change the subject.","edited":{"userid":1889,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1889-thefrigidmidget","user":"TheFrigidMidget","date":". 01-02-2014, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":